at different time points, for the youngest age group (16–17 years old).
All answers at q0/q1 that are not "Pas sur les listes" are not exactly correct.](index.fr_files/figure-html/fig-vote_derniers_elections-youngest-1.png){#fig-vote_derniers_elections-youngest width=672}
:::
